    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div><b>1:24:51</b> (6:29/mi avg by chip). A goal by 8 seconds. Owen ran 1:22:10, hit his goal on the nose.</div><div><br/></div><table style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>mile</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>split</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b></b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>mile</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>split</b></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">1</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:33</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">8</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:37</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">2</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:30</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">9</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:26</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">3</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:29</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">10</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:24</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">4</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:27</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">11</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:22</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">5</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:26</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">12</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:20</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:28</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">13</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:18</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">7</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:41</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">last 0.14 (watch long)</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">0:50</td></tr></table><div><br/></div><ul><li>Avg HR 173, max 188 in the last 400 m.</li><li>Hill (7-8) cost ~20 s total vs flat pace, exactly what the plan allowed.</li><li>Gels at 4.5 / 8.5 worked, no stomach issues.</li><li>Negative split second half. First race since college where the last 3 miles were the fastest.</li></ul><div><br/></div><div>Next: 2 weeks easy, then think about Block 5 / a spring full? Owen keeps saying CIM.</div></en-note>]]>
    </content>
  </note>
